				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7602c428-e3a3-5c4b-9387-d760044012e1")
	)
	(text_box "Identical to stack A, own parts, own string, own nodes. No part or net is shared between the stacks except HV_CAP_P and HV_RTN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 667.4 149.208 0)
		(size 304.04 4.159)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6a0fb863-d8e3-5e9a-95a3-40c2e11faf28")
	)
	(text_box "Stack B hold: HOLD_B_DRV (1.5 kHz) -> 4-stage pump -> 470 ohm -> STKB_G; release Q1110 with MMBFJ270 pilot; two held optos U1102/U1106 -> HOLD_B_HELD_N / HOLD_B_HELD2_N"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 335.351 0)
		(size 287.24 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1560a8be-1d7e-5d66-aae6-e36baf470a39")
	)
	(text_box "Identical to stack A's hold circuit (R1195 470 ohm; second sensor R1198, D1134, R1199, U1106, TP1108). HOLD_B_DRV comes from the 3V3_SUP buffer on 09 (supervisor's clock HOLD_S_CLK)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 341.701 0)
		(size 287.24 4.159)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dab13078-af97-5798-aaa3-79c33dfcbc60")
	)
	(text_box "Over-voltage force (R-10): OVP_TRIP -> Q1111 -> one TLP187 LED per stack; transistors short each bottom gate to HV_RTN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.96 355.514 0)
		(size 203.24 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e880c57a-3bd7-59f7-975d-e169fb6c0fae")
	)
	(text_box "OVP_TRIP high (08 comparator, 2,107 V nominal, latched until OVP_RST, contract issue 3) turns Q1111 on; 3V3_SUP drives about 8 mA through each LED (separate 240 ohm resistors, so\none open LED does not disable the other). Each Darlington (collector HV_RTN, emitter STKx_G, VCEO 300 V) sinks >= 35 mA, which overpowers its running pump (short-circuit current\nabout 10-15 mA [SIM]) and pulls the gate to about -0.4..-1 V: both stacks conduct even while both controllers keep clocking. Default: OVP_TRIP pulled down 100 k here (contract\n§5.4) -> no LED current -> no force. 3V3_SUP is used on this sheet for these LEDs only (contract §4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.96 361.864 0)
		(size 203.24 10.636)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "af87cd7f-c523-5fbf-9e43-a5b7f6b3131f")
	)
